          "payload": {
            "artifact_id": "mathscape:artifact/sha256/8c9f86d28c98fb9e035d731c68fbef9d407634b6d917fbade7266c528d91e4b2",
            "md_byte_range": {
              "start": 193,
              "end": 264
            },
            "granularity": "inline",
            "quote": "## 《星港母函数讲义》§2.1　普通母函数与有限几何和"
          }
        },
        {
          "local_ref": "jia.s.def",
          "kind": "source_span",
          "op": "create",
          "payload": {
            "artifact_id": "mathscape:artifact/sha256/8c9f86d28c98fb9e035d731c68fbef9d407634b6d917fbade7266c528d91e4b2",
            "md_byte_range": {
              "start": 305,
              "end": 658
            },
            "granularity": "inline",
            "quote": "**定义 2.1.1（普通母函数）**　设数列 $(a_n)_{n \\ge 0}$ 取值于交换环 $R$。形式幂级数 $A(x) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a_n x^n \\in R[[x]]$ 称为数列 $(a_n)_{n \\ge 0}$ 的普通母函数，记 $[x^n] A(x) = a_n$ 为第 $n$ 次项系数。形式幂级数只按各项系数比较相等，不讨论把 $x$ 代入实数后的收敛性。"
          }
        },
        {
          "local_ref": "jia.s.thm",
          "kind": "source_span",
          "op": "create",
          "payload": {
            "artifact_id": "mathscape:artifact/sha256/8c9f86d28c98fb9e035d731c68fbef9d407634b6d917fbade7266c528d91e4b2",
            "md_byte_range": {
              "start": 699,
              "end": 1045
            },
            "granularity": "inline",
            "quote": "**定理 2.1.2（有限几何级数）**　设整数 $N \\ge 1$，实数 $x \\in \\mathbb{R}$，记有限和 $S_N(x) = \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1} x^k$。则分两种互斥完备的情形：(1) 当 $x \\neq 1$ 时，$S_N(x) = \\frac{1 - x^N}{1 - x}$；(2) 当 $x = 1$（退化边界）时，分母 $1 - x = 0$ 使分式无定义，逐项相加得 $S_N(1) = N$。"
          }
        },
        {
          "local_ref": "jia.s.cor",
          "kind": "source_span",
          "op": "create",
          "payload": {
            "artifact_id": "mathscape:artifact/sha256/8c9f86d28c98fb9e035d731c68fbef9d407634b6d917fbade7266c528d91e4b2",
            "md_byte_range": {
              "start": 1086,
              "end": 1388
            },
            "granularity": "inline",
            "quote": "**推论 2.1.3（形式逆元与收敛排除）**　在形式幂级数环 $R[[x]]$ 中，恒等式 $(1 - x)\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} x^n = 1$ 无条件成立；但若把 $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} x^n$ 当作实变数无穷级数求值，则在 $|x| \\ge 1$ 处级数发散，不能代入分式 $\\frac{1}{1 - x}$。"
          }
        },
        {
          "local_ref": "jia.u.sec",
          "kind": "source_unit",
          "op": "create",
          "payload": {
            "kind": "section",
            "display_title": "§2.1 普通母函数与有限几何和",
            "parent": null,
            "source_spans": [
              "$new:jia.s.sec"
            ],
            "completeness": "complete"
          }
        },
        {
