          "payload": {
            "artifact_id": "mathscape:artifact/sha256/770b4a1b3741d038e5a3c405dd07844200da1f0a89e914a1718e5b4f23db1768",
            "md_byte_range": {
              "start": 192,
              "end": 257
            },
            "granularity": "inline",
            "quote": "## 《灯塔母函数初步》§1.3　生成函数与等比求和"
          }
        },
        {
          "local_ref": "yi.s.def",
          "kind": "source_span",
          "op": "create",
          "payload": {
            "artifact_id": "mathscape:artifact/sha256/770b4a1b3741d038e5a3c405dd07844200da1f0a89e914a1718e5b4f23db1768",
            "md_byte_range": {
              "start": 297,
              "end": 579
            },
            "granularity": "inline",
            "quote": "**定义 1.3.1**　本书的正项标号数列 $(b_m)_{m \\ge 1}$ 一律从第 1 项起算。若幂级数 $g(t) = \\sum_{m=1}^{\\infty} b_m t^m$ 在某开区间 $(-r, r)$（$r > 0$）内绝对收敛，则称该区间上的实函数 $g(t)$ 为数列 $(b_m)_{m \\ge 1}$ 的生成函数。"
          }
        },
        {
          "local_ref": "yi.s.prop",
          "kind": "source_span",
          "op": "create",
          "payload": {
            "artifact_id": "mathscape:artifact/sha256/770b4a1b3741d038e5a3c405dd07844200da1f0a89e914a1718e5b4f23db1768",
            "md_byte_range": {
              "start": 620,
              "end": 774
            },
            "granularity": "inline",
            "quote": "**命题 1.3.2（有限等比和公式）**　对正整数 $N \\ge 1$ 与实数 $t \\neq 1$，有 $1 + t + t^2 + \\dots + t^{N-1} = \\frac{1 - t^N}{1 - t}$。"
          }
        },
        {
          "local_ref": "yi.s.rem",
          "kind": "source_span",
          "op": "create",
          "payload": {
            "artifact_id": "mathscape:artifact/sha256/770b4a1b3741d038e5a3c405dd07844200da1f0a89e914a1718e5b4f23db1768",
            "md_byte_range": {
              "start": 814,
              "end": 1009
            },
            "granularity": "inline",
            "quote": "**注 1.3.3**　令 $N \\to \\infty$，当 $|t| < 1$ 时有 $\\sum_{m=0}^{\\infty} t^m = \\frac{1}{1 - t}$；当 $|t| \\ge 1$ 时无穷等比级数发散，上式右端不再表示左端的级数和。"
          }
        },
        {
          "local_ref": "yi.u.sec",
          "kind": "source_unit",
          "op": "create",
          "payload": {
            "kind": "section",
            "display_title": "§1.3 生成函数与等比求和",
